# No competitor or reference product names in files

Never mention competitor products, inspirations, or design references in any repository artifact:

- Source code, comments, CSS, HTML, JS, TS
- Commit messages and PR titles/bodies
- Cache-bust query strings (`?v=…`)
- Docs, plans committed to the repo, landing/marketing copy
- Variable names, class names, branch names you create

Describe ObraMate features in product terms only (e.g. "Jobs overview layout"), not as "X-style" or "inspired by Y".

Exception: third-party libraries/APIs actually used (Google Maps, Leaflet, Prisma, etc.) may be named when technically required.
